#: ../../operations/analytics/capacity_planning.rst:33
msgid "**Memory Capacity**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/analytics/capacity_planning.rst:35
msgid ""
"Displays historical memory utilization across filtered hosts with a trend"
" projection. The chart shows:"
